  "worked_solution": "The function $f(x)$ is continuous on $[1,4],$ therefore, the intermediate value theorem guarantees that $f(x)=k$ has a solution for each value of $k$ between $f(1)$ and $f(4).$\n\nSince $f(1)=2$ and $f(4)=66,$ we must have \n$k\\in [2,66].$\n\nAmong the given options, only $k=1$ does not belong to the interval $[2,66].$",
